    url:
    description: 'Greenhouse gas emissions forecast and scenario planning tool for
      the 2025 Strategic Climate Action Plan. Projects activity, emission factors
      and emissions to 2050 under a no-action scenario and quantifies 25 named policy
      wedges.; Attachment: 2025_SCAP_GHG_Wedge_Analysis_Final.xlsx; Format: .xlsx;
      Geographic Coverage: Selected Washington counties; King County selected; Date
      Last Updated: 2024-09-03'
  - name: King County GHG Emissions Trend 2007-2023
    authority: Cascadia Consulting Group for King County; 
      andream@cascadiaconsulting.com
    url:
    description: 'Appended inventory database and summary trend tables for the eight
      King County inventory years 2007, 2008, 2015, 2017, 2019, 2020, 2022 and 2023.;
      Attachment: King County GHG Trend 2007 - 2023.xlsx; Format: .xlsx; Geographic
      Coverage: King County, WA and its 39 cities; Date Last Updated: 2025-11-04'
